        "## Data Limitation\n",
        "\n",
        "This analysis uses only one month (March 2026) of data. As a result, it may not capture seasonal trends or longer-term changes in content performance. The results should therefore be interpreted as a snapshot rather than a complete picture.\n",
        "\n",
        "* I intentionally created a feature (leaked_feature) directly from the target-related column (gsc_clicks). This represents data leakage because it contains information that would not be available when making a real prediction. Such a feature could make model performance appear unrealistically high. After demonstrating the issue, I removed the leaked feature to keep the feature set honest."
      ],
      "id": "5NvQUr_7yqXI"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Feature 1 – gsc_impressions\n",
        "Knowable at the decision moment because historical Search Console impressions are already available.\n",
        "\n",
        "### Feature 2 – gsc_clicks\n",
        "Knowable at the decision moment because previous click counts are known before prediction.\n",
        "\n",
        "### Feature 3 – ga4_pageviews\n",
        "Knowable at the decision moment because page views are historical website activity.\n",
        "\n",
        "### Feature 4 – ga4_sessions\n",
        "Knowable at the decision moment because historical session counts are recorded before prediction.\n",
        "\n",
        "### Feature 5 – gsc_avg_position\n",
        "Knowable at the decision moment because historical search position is available before future outcomes occur."
      ],
